OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow Elfingrove event scrapped
OL,4,Aone day after tickets go on sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Glasgow Christmas event in that
OL,7,Fpromised to be a multi-million pound
OL,8,F"premium experience" has been scrapped
OL,9,Fjust one day after tickets went on
OL,10,Fsale.
OL,12,FDiscount deals website Itison, the
OL,13,Fevent organiser, said there was not
OL,14,Fenough demand on the first day of sales
OL,15,Fto "confidently take the event
OL,16,Fforward".
OL,18,FElfingrove was scheduled to run at the
OL,19,Fcity's Kelvingrove Museum from 26
OL,20,FNovember until 13 December with a 360
OL,21,Fdegree projection show, miniature train
OL,22,Fride and outdoor Christmas market.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
